{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2005-common-biology-13","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2005,"subject":"biology","number":13,"points":null,"unitId":"development","unitLabel":"발생·분화","topic":"분화·배엽","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["development","cell"],"stem":"그림은동물반구에서떼어낸조각을개별세포로분리한후\n액티빈(activin)을처리한실험의모식도이다.\n위실험의결과에대한설명이나추론중옳은것을<보기>에서\n모두고른것은?\n<보\n기>\nㄱ. 액티빈은동물반구쪽에서합성되기시작할것이다.\nㄴ. 동물반구꼭대기의할구들은외배엽으로분화할운명을\n갖고있다.\nㄷ. 중배엽조직의분화는액티빈의농도구배를따라일어날\n것이다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t012"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t013"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t014"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄱ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t015"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t016"]}],"answer":null,"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerStatus":"untranscribed","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":687,"height":496,"region":0,"bbox":[26.856,46.104,274.8,198.4],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2005-common-biology-13/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":772,"height":264,"region":0,"bbox":[14.056,306.904,308.8,105.6],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2005-common-biology-13/02.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":4,"sourceRect":[82.744,621.896,416.5,1075.77],"width":333.756,"height":453.874,"items":[{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-01","bbox":[26.856,46.104,274.8,198.4],"section":"stem"},{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-02","bbox":[14.056,306.904,308.8,105.6],"section":"stem"},{"id":"t001","type":"text","text":"13. 그림은동물반구에서떼어낸조각을개별세포로분리한후","bbox":[5.0,5.0,318.54,11.035],"spans":[{"text":"13.","bbox":[5.0,5.0,12.385,11.035],"origin":[5.0,13.828],"size":10.752,"flags":0,"font":"T9"},{"text":" 그림은동물반","bbox":[17.385,5.0,75.287,11.035],"